@startuml
' ============================================
' ooad-phase:   物件設計
' chapter:      6-1
' realizes:     UC-05, FR-07, FR-17
' source:       backend/src/services/line.service.js, backend/src/services/courseAccess.service.js, backend/src/models/enrollment.model.js（程式碼）
' verified:     2026-09-19
' status:       draft
' implemented:  yes
' ai-assisted:  yes / OpenAI Codex / 依 active Enrollment、published Course、live Video 與 postback state guard 重繪
' ============================================
!include ../_style.puml

title LINE切換課程循序圖

hide footbox
autonumber

actor "學生" as Student
participant "LINE Platform" as LinePlatform
participant "LineSignatureMiddleware" as Signature
participant "LineController" as LineController
participant "LineService" as LineService
database "User model" as UserModel
database "Enrollment／Course models" as CourseModels
database "Video model" as VideoModel
participant "LINE Reply API" as ReplyApi

Student -> LinePlatform : 傳送「切換課程」
LinePlatform -> Signature : signed webhook message
Signature -> LineController : verified event
LineController -> LineService : processWebhookEvents(event)
LineService -> UserModel : findOne({ lineUserId })
LineService -> CourseModels : find(active Enrollment).populate(Course)
LineService -> LineService : 只保留 published Course
LineService -> VideoModel : filterCoursesWithLiveVideos(courses)
VideoModel --> LineService : 至少有一筆 Video 的課程

alt 沒有可選課程
  LineService -> UserModel : state=idle
  LineService -> ReplyApi : replyMessage(目前沒有可切換課程)
else 有可選課程
  LineService -> ReplyApi : 最多 4 個 postback 按鈕
  LineService -> UserModel : state=awaiting_course_selection
  ReplyApi --> LinePlatform : 顯示課程選單
  Student -> LinePlatform : 點選 select_course postback
  LinePlatform -> Signature : signed webhook postback
  Signature -> LineController : verified event
  LineController -> LineService : processWebhookEvents(event)
  LineService -> UserModel : findOne({ lineUserId })
  LineService -> LineService : 驗證 state=awaiting_course_selection
  LineService -> CourseModels : find Course + findActiveEnrollment()
  LineService -> VideoModel : filterCoursesWithLiveVideos([course])
  alt 狀態錯誤、無修課、未發布或無影片
    LineService -> ReplyApi : replyMessage(拒絕原因)
  else 驗證通過
    LineService -> UserModel : 寫 activeCourseId、state=idle\n清除對話歷史
    LineService -> ReplyApi : replyMessage(課程切換成功)
  end
end

note over LineService,CourseModels
  Course.published 是可用狀態，不單獨構成授權；LINE 選單與 postback 都要求 active Enrollment。
end note

@enduml
